<h2>Why bother with Maven in Eclipse</h2>
<p>If you like repeatable builds and not crying over transitive dependency nightmares then Maven is your friend. This guide walks you through creating a Maven project in Eclipse for Java development using an archetype and a clean POM setup. We keep things practical and honest with a pinch of sarcasm for flavor.</p>
